  "note": "Snapshot v1 (docs/native-engine-plan.md §5.3-5.4; player/engine-contract.js, NE-11j): the schema's snapshot examples as contractAccepts, and extrapolate(snapshot, receivedAtMs, nowMs) - frozen while inSeamGap, buffering or not running, clamped to [0, duration].",
